sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client workflow
    participant P as PRP API / Jobs
    participant W as Qualified workers
    participant S as Artifact service
    U->>C: Record and send audio
    C->>P: Upload + ASR request/job
    P->>W: ASR with reserved resource
    W-->>P: ASR result
    P-->>C: Validated transcript
    Note over U,S: Client validates transcript and composes its own context; no central PRP business memory
    C->>P: Chat with supplied messages
    P-->>C: Canonical answer text
    C->>P: TTS for saved answer
    P->>W: Preset TTS with reservation
    W->>S: Validated audio output
    S-->>C: Authorized artifact via PRP
    C-->>U: Text + audio playback
    Note over U,S: ALT: TTS fails -> client PARTIAL_SUCCESS; retain text, retry TTS only; PRP TTS job is FAILED
